@startuml
title APT-SD-D04 Cashier Authentication, Shift, Site/Site Group Binding Flow
skinparam shadowing false

actor Cashier
participant "Assisted Payment Terminal" as APT
participant "Identity / RBAC / Device Trust" as Identity
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Audit / Event" as Audit

Cashier -> APT : start terminal session
APT -> Identity : validate device identity and trust
APT -> Identity : authenticate cashier
APT -> Central : validate Site/Site Group assignment
APT -> Central : validate active shift/session
alt all prerequisites valid
  Central --> APT : workflow access allowed
  APT -> Audit : session start context
else invalid device / cashier / scope / shift
  Central --> APT : block or route to authorized correction
  APT -> Audit : denied access context
end

note bottom
Lookup, discount capture, payment, fiscal display, and exit status
are blocked until required context is valid.
end note
@enduml
